[{"id":2881902558,"node_id":"PRR_kwDOAO6SJc6rxlfe","state":"APPROVED","user":{"site_admin":false,"suspended":false,"updated_at":"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/180032?u=68d23e7ee9cdf810da125e8510b72f845b9dccc8&v=4","created_at":"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z","followers":0,"following":0,"html_url":"https://github.com/Calinou","id":180032,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE4MDAzMg==","login":"Calinou","type":"User","owned_private_repos":0,"public_gists":0,"public_repos":0,"total_private_repos":0,"url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou"},"body":"Tested locally, it works as expected. Code and documentation look good to me.\r\n\r\n**Testing project:** [tonemap_color_correction.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/20523588/tonemap_color_correction.zip)\r\nAlso in a branch: https://github.com/Calinou/godot-demo-projects/tree/tonemap-improve-agx\r\n\r\nBefore | After\r\n-|-\r\n![Screenshot_20250530_181351](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/624ac8ce-16fc-4d99-9fe6-a7e1d7f7f0e6) | ![Screenshot_20250530_180654](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/5a13f038-7aca-4924-a2e6-73588917efe4)\r\n\r\n### Whitepoint 16.0\r\n\r\n![Screenshot_20250530_180704](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/b6ae5b4d-df1d-41e6-bfbe-57eaee93ed69)\r\n\r\n### Whitepoint 0.1\r\n\r\nThere seems to be a slight visual difference between 0.1 and 2.0. Should the value be clamped to avoid this? Either way, the whitepoint setting seems to make little difference in AgX compared to other tonemappers. Here, it only affects the bright glowing cube/sphere on the left.\r\n\r\n![Screenshot_20250530_180729](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/42ec87e0-fac3-4af9-b785-39a34467cc87)\r\n","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/106940#pullrequestreview-2881902558","pull_request_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/106940","author_association":"MEMBER","submitted_at":"2025-05-30T16:55:04Z"},{"id":2881757024,"node_id":"PRR_kw